A module adds a greeting to any class that includes it.

module Greeter
  def greet
    "hello from #{self.class}"
  end
end

A person includes the module.

class Person
  include Greeter
end

Then we make one: person = Person.new
and we ask it to greet us: greeting = !-1.greet
then we print the greeting: puts !-1
and print it again through the person: puts !-2.greet
